        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$cherimp_intro",
        "key": "$cherimp_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've defeated Reunion's forces!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Bah. For a bunch of roadblocks, these guys were a bit tough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no sign of Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're in a real mess now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's not responding to my calls either! Tsk... This part of her hasn't ever changed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "L.G.D.! All members, prepare to follow me--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Inspector Hoshiguma.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should let us handle it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're approaching the Originium-dense zones left by the Catastrophe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you go any further, the healthy risk being infected by Oripathy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "These consequences are too dire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore, as Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Given your small stature, it's cute when you try to give serious speeches.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? Huh?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha, I was just giving you a hard time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you don't have to persuade me. I understand your concern.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "L.G.D.! We will be Rhodes Island's shield!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Block the entrance, and don't let a single Reunion member enter or exit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll let the experts handle this problem!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Inspector...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, just call me Hoshiguma.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go. Please take care of Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Make sure you bring her back with you in one piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I will, Hoshiguma...! I swear I'll bring Madam Ch'en back safely...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Make sure to stay safe yourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, please follow me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island, let's go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
